      "id": "claim_5034c33321bb4d4fbcaf198602d08bd0",
      "statement": "Crestline Business Online (CBO) is CNB's commercial digital banking portal (web and mobile) for Treasury Management clients; its Wire Center module provides domestic (Fedwire) and international (Swift) wire initiation, templates, dual approval, step-up authenticated release, activity list and confirmation downloads, but lacks milestone tracking, gpi status, hold explanations or client actions on held wires, and originates ~67% of CNB's outgoing wires.",
