    {
      "id": "claim_9c84cb222a4847d78d5601c0724e96e0",
      "statement": "PRISM Payments Hub (PPH), built on the vendor Volaris Payment Platform, is CNB's wire orchestration platform for all channels and rails; it validates/enriches instructions, calls the Payment Risk & Screening Platform (PRSP) synchronously for screening, performs funds control against the Core Deposit Platform (CDP), and routes releases to the Payment Network Gateway for Fedwire or Swift/gpi delivery.",
