    {
      "id": "claim_363eb3370c2748a7bee1298dc69cc67d",
      "statement": "Governance forums gate payments changes: the monthly Payments Architecture Review Board (ARB) is required for new client-facing integrations to payment systems, FCT Change Advisory with FCC sign-off is required for hold/screening changes, and the bi-weekly Disclosure Review Committee approves client-facing copy and notification templates; dependency conflicts escalate from engineering managers to Directors to the PTT Leadership Team, and compliance/policy interpretation questions route to FCC Policy & Advisory or the Privacy Office rather than being decided by engineering.",
